    {
      "name": "Fashion Show",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>When the party prepares for their first day at the beach, have each player describe how their PC changes their attire to be more appropriate for the environment. The GM gives the PC with the freshest look a <strong>d6</strong> Fresh Die that can be spent to add to any action or reaction roll.</p><section id=\"secret-21Ozr0QIVF23Y6Cl\" class=\"secret\"><p>What's the fashion in this area? Where do the PCs source their new beach-themed articles and accessories?</p></section>",
